    <briefdescription>
<para>Abstract clock interface for time operations. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>Provides an abstraction over std::chrono to enable deterministic testing through clock injection. Tests can use <ref refid="classthemis_1_1utils_1_1_mock_clock" kindref="compound">MockClock</ref> while production code uses <ref refid="classthemis_1_1utils_1_1_system_clock" kindref="compound">SystemClock</ref>. </para>
    </detaileddescription>
